# Grey Wellness

> Grey Wellness is a specialized bilingual mental health practice founded by Mónica Grey (MS, LCPC, NCC). The practice specializes in Cognitive Behavioral Therapy for Insomnia (CBT-I), anxiety treatment, and trauma-informed psychotherapy (including Cognitive Processing Therapy / CPT) for adults. Sessions are provided virtually across Maryland in English and Spanish.

