- **Practice Name**: Grey Wellness LLC
- **Founder & Lead Therapist**: Mónica Grey, MS, LCPC, NCC
- **Credentials**:
  - Master of Science in Mental Health Counseling from Johns Hopkins University
  - Licensed Clinical Professional Counselor (LCPC) in the State of Maryland
  - National Certified Counselor (NCC, National Board for Certified Counselors)
  - Member, Society of Behavioral Sleep Medicine (SBSM)
